# Shared remote rule set
# Grok / xAI
# Sources: v2fly/domain-list-community data/xai + VPSDance ai-proxy-rules x-ai.yaml
# Do not add DOMAIN-KEYWORD,grok (hits ngrok). Do not suffix x.com (steals Twitter).

DOMAIN-SUFFIX,grok.com
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,grok.x.com
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,grokipedia.com
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,x.ai
